# AgentsDocContract.registry -- the document-contract guard's registry.
# One row per registered document extension, four TAB-separated columns.
#   kind      the validator kind of a document with this extension (routine, epic, ...)
#   extension the file-name ending that selects the row, with its leading dot (.routine.md)
#   state     refusing | reporting | absent
#               refusing   a refusing fault the write introduces refuses the write
#               reporting  the fault is said and the write goes on
#               absent     the type is declared and its contract is not written yet: allow
#   contract  the kind's contract file, a bare name under magic-team/contracts, or - for absent
# An extension not named here is not a document type: the guard's default allows the write and
# decides nothing.
#
# Slice 1: the routine kind is registered, refusing.
routine	.routine.md	refusing	routine.contract.format.md
